
Title

  System read
    electrons           6
    nobrillouintheorem
    freeformat
    guga 0
    nonuniformrandexcits guga-gas-pchb delocalised

    GAS-SPEC LOCAl 2
        3 4 6
        3 0 2
        3*1 3*2

    SPLITGAS-SPEC LOCAl 2
        3 6 6
        3 0 0
        3*1 3*2


Endsys

  Calc
    totalWalkers  500

    load-balance-blocks off

    seed 1

    nmcyc 1500
    semi-stochastic 0
    pops-core 100
    readpops

    definedet 1-6

    tau-values  start from-popsfile
    tau-search  off

    methods
        method vertex fcimc
    endmethods

    target-shiftdamp 0.01

    proje-changeref 1.6
    memoryfacspawn 100.0
    memoryfacpart 50.0
    truncinitiator
    addtoinitiator 3
    allrealcoeff
    realspawncutoff 0.40

  Endcalc

  Logging
    highlypopwrite 50
    hdf5-pops
  Endlog
End

